**The read:** Enneagram Type 3, 3w2, social subtype. Confidence high.

The thesis is that Brooke Monk got famous performing a world she'd never entered — Forbes' own line is *"She became famous making videos about a world she'd never lived in"* — and that the effortless-girl-in-her-bedroom look is the single most engineered thing about her. The white wall is stripped on purpose so a scrolling thumb has nothing to look at but her face. She's posted by 1 p.m. every day since September 4, 2019, with two exceptions she named out loud.

